### Predictions

`predict()` generates subject-specific survival probabilities or cumulative hazard estimates at
specified time points. It works the same way as for `CoxPH` and `CoxNet`:

::: {#3417dc2f .cell execution_count=54}
``` {.python .cell-code}
# Predicted survival curves at 6-month intervals for the first three subjects
aalen.predict(lung[["age", "sex"]][:3], type="survival", times=[180, 365, 540], format="polars")
```

