The survival probabilities are computed from the cumulative hazard, which is built by summing each
subject's covariate-weighted coefficient increments. Pass `type="cumhaz"` for the cumulative hazard
directly:

::: {#5312ed1b .cell execution_count=55}
``` {.python .cell-code}
# Cumulative hazard at the same time points
aalen.predict(lung[["age", "sex"]][:3], type="cumhaz", times=[180, 365, 540], format="polars")
```

