### Summarizing with tidy and glance

The `tidy()` and `glance()` functions work with `AalenAdditive`. `tidy()` returns the summary test
table with one row per term (intercept plus covariates):

::: {#c514b0e9 .cell execution_count=56}
``` {.python .cell-code}
# Tidy: slope test for each term
gw.tidy(aalen, format="polars")
